# Pre-existing PHPStan findings, accepted as of the run that generated this
# file. `composer run analyse` is green because of it, not in spite of it: a
# clean run means NO NEW finding beyond what is recorded here, never zero
# findings ever.
#
# Regenerate it (`composer run analyse:baseline`) ONLY to deliberately accept
# existing debt you are not fixing right now — NEVER to silence a finding your
# own change just introduced. Fix that one instead. A baseline regenerated to
# hide a regression turns the whole gate into decoration, which is worse than
# having no gate at all because everybody believes it is working.
#
# See README.md § Static analysis.

